<title>USA: Virginia $32 mln housing bonds won by Prudential. [CORRECTED 16:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Virginia $32 mln housing bonds won by Prudential. [CORRECTED 16:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities (corrects from Wheat First Butcher Singer) said Thursday it won $32 million Virginia Housing Development Authority bonds at a true interest cost of 7.3535 (corrects) percent.</p>
</text>
